; Link case: the third module for 1main.a66. Its part of the COMMON section
; is the longer one, and its BITADDRESSABLE section must skip the byte that
; Pins uses.
$MOD167
Shared  SECTION BIT COMMON
Sh2:    DBIT    9
Shared  ENDS

Late    SECTION BIT BYTE
L1:     DBIT
Late    ENDS

More    SECTION DATA BITADDRESSABLE
        DB      1
More    ENDS

Prog3   SECTION CODE
Helper3 PROC    NEAR
        BSET    Sh2
        BSET    Sh2+8
        BSET    L1
        RET
Helper3 ENDP
Prog3   ENDS
        END
